WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.867
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:01.867 --> 00:00:02.935
We're hanging out with
Maisie Williams,

00:00:02.935 --> 00:00:04.070
and we're about to
play a new game

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.639
called Like, Follow, Block.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.674
♪ -Like, follow, block, yeah ♪

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:10.743
♪ Like, follow, block, yeah ♪

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:12.778
♪ Like, follow, block, yeah ♪

00:00:12.778 --> 00:00:15.081
♪ Like, follow, block, yeah ♪

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:18.384
-So, to start you off, I'm going
to give you three choices,

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.152
and you'll have to tell me,
out of the three,

00:00:20.152 --> 00:00:22.422
which one would you
like a post from,

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:25.892
which one you'd follow,
and which one you would block.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.126
Sound good?

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.727
-Absolutely.

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:30.763
-Alright, let's start
with our first three options.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:33.599 line:0%
Tacos, pizza, and burgers.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.435 line:0%
Maisie?

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:36.636 line:0%
-Okay.

00:00:36.636 --> 00:00:42.274 line:0%
I would like pizza.

00:00:42.274 --> 00:00:43.543 line:0%
This is a hard one.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:46.912 line:0%
-Yeah, it is.
-I'd like the posts of pizzas.

00:00:46.912 --> 00:00:48.614 line:0%
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:52.352 line:0%
-And then I would follow tacos,
because I could eat those

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:56.956 line:0%
all day every day, and I want to
see those posts coming in.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.092 line:0%
And then I'd
have to block burgers.

00:00:59.092 --> 00:01:01.728 line:0%
-What?! Wow!
-I know.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.163 line:0%
-But hey.
It's not me playing.

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:06.466 line:0%
Here we go. Who cares?

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:07.834 line:0%
Next round, here we go.

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:12.238 line:0%
We have spinning, we have yoga,
and we have treadmill.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:15.575 line:0%
-Okay. Spinning needs to die.
I hate it.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.643 line:0%
-I agree, I agree.
-Block, the worst.

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:20.146 line:0%
-Never, yes, I don't even
like it on the screen.

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.247 line:0%
I'm going to look elsewhere.

00:01:22.247 --> 00:01:25.184 line:0%
-Get away.
I can't even look at it.

00:01:25.184 --> 00:01:30.289 line:0%
The treadmill also sucks,
but we have to put it somewhere,

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:34.227 line:0%
so let's say that we'll like.

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:36.829 line:0%
And then yoga,
I actually enjoy yoga.

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:41.300 line:0%
You can go very, very slow
and basically just stretch

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.601 line:0%
and you don't have to
work that hard,

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:44.270 line:0%
so we'll follow yoga.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:45.805 line:0%
-Ah, I love this.
This is so good.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.640 line:0%
Alright, let's do
another round here.

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.910 line:0%
You have ketchup stain
on the shirt,

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:55.348 line:0%
something stuck in your teeth,
and accidently swallowing a bug.

00:01:55.348 --> 00:01:57.616 line:0%
Well, come on.
-Oh, man.

00:01:57.616 --> 00:02:00.353 line:0%
-Let's say no one saw you
swallow the bug.

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:01.921 line:0%
-Okay.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:04.890 line:0%
Well, I don't know.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:09.862 line:0%
Food in the teeth is pretty
horrible when that happens.

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:13.265 line:0%
And when it happens to someone
else, I can't just ignore it.

00:02:13.265 --> 00:02:17.637 line:0%
I will just be like,
"There is food in your mouth."

00:02:17.637 --> 00:02:21.407 line:0%
-You will?
That's a good friend.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:24.376 line:0%
-Yeah, I'm staring at it,
and they're talking to me

00:02:24.376 --> 00:02:26.012 line:0%
and I just think,
"I have to tell you

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:28.180 line:0%
there's a massive piece of food
in your teeth."

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.618 line:0%
And they usually get quite sad
about it, but it is what it is.

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:33.887 line:0%
But I block that,
because it sucks. It's horrible.

00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:34.787 line:0%
-Yep.

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:39.725 line:0%
-Ketchup stain, I'll follow.

00:02:39.725 --> 00:02:41.761 line:0%
You know, why not?
It's okay.

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:42.995 line:0%
It happens a lot.

00:02:42.995 --> 00:02:44.897 line:0%
It's an easy thing to happen.

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:48.234 line:0%
And then swallow a bug,
I guess like swallowing a bug.

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:50.536 line:0%
I mean, I'm not --
It always, you know --

00:02:50.536 --> 00:02:52.505 line:0%
It feels kind of like lucky,
you know?

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:55.941 line:0%
It's quite rare that it happens
and you're like, "Oh."

00:02:55.941 --> 00:02:57.977 line:0%
-Lucky, oh, my God.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:02:59.478 line:0%
Lucky bug.

00:02:59.478 --> 00:03:02.248 line:0%
Okay, here we go, last round.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:07.353 line:0%
We have BTS, One Direction,
and the Backstreet Boys.

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:09.488 line:0%
-Okay, wow.

00:03:09.488 --> 00:03:11.857 line:0%
-This is good.

00:03:11.857 --> 00:03:15.795 line:0%
-Stan BTS, all day, every day.

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:18.964 line:0%
Follow and like.

00:03:18.964 --> 00:03:22.901 line:0%
One Direction, also, you know,
whichever, follow, like.

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:25.971 line:0%
And then Backstreet Boys, like,
come on, guys. Bye.

00:03:25.971 --> 00:03:27.973 line:0%
-No! Really?!

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:31.443 line:0%
Oh, Maisie, Backstreet Boys,
though, they're great.

00:03:31.443 --> 00:03:34.079 line:0%
-They haven't been relevant
since I was born. I'm sorry.

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:36.682 line:0%
-Oh, my gosh.
They haven't not been relevant.

00:03:36.682 --> 00:03:38.851 line:0%
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.420 line:0%
This has all been fun.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:42.455 line:0%
I'm getting to know you
more and more and more.

00:03:42.455 --> 00:03:43.723 line:0%
That was awesome.

00:03:43.723 --> 00:03:45.258 line:0%
Maisie Williams, everybody.

